^store: disk 16384 KiB, boot 2, [1-9][0-9]* objects and [0-9]+ refs from earlier boots$
^snap:latest +[0-9a-f]{12}  wasm32$
^(/[^ ]* )?\$ dock run snap$
^writer: no /etc/motd$
^writer: count 2$
^\[snap-1 exited with 0\]$
^init exited \(0\)$
^writer: motd: Hello from dock build$
^      2       2      12$
